{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>超軟心creamy+香濃芝士味</p><p>人氣IG網店爆紅芝士蛋糕！</p><p>人氣IG網店「魔女布丁」經常會到商場開期間限定店，最近就由即日起至9月27日在元朗YOHO 一田門口擺檔。現場除了賣招牌手作布丁外，仲帶來新品軟心雙重芝士蛋糕，一推出即在threads爆紅，不少人大讚好食又creamy！</p><p>$188個超軟心芝士蛋糕！</p><p>店家出品的軟心雙重芝士蛋糕外觀不花巧，而最大特色是細膩軟滑的口感，中間做到香滑creamy，芝士味香濃不膩，各位Cheesecake控一定要試！芝士蛋糕5吋$188，足夠4人享用，Cp值超高！</p><p>魔女布丁 期間限定店：元朗YOHO 一期L1一田門口 營業時間：1130-2030， 即日起至9月27號</p><p>官方IG：@witch.pudding</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178876083004077496_16901295776a9e52fe91e73.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178876083142979761_14602324136a9e53001b617.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178876083377479490_346113946a9e53028b563.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178876083645679636_4710999226a9e53051d649.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178876083845539548_6187921486a9e5306d4e0e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178876084016581090_18405902206a9e530901e59.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178876084306535086_10851884716a9e530cd1960.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T06:19:08.357414+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":397,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}